{
 "about": "NVFP4 activation global-scale fix for the routed experts: the checkpoint stores input_scale = amax/(6*448), so the kernel multiplier 1/input_scale is 448x the modelopt convention and its e4m3 block scale saturates at 448, clipping the activation at 2688/gscale. div[layer] divides w2_input_global_scale so that gscale becomes 2/amax_gx, where amax_gx is the per-layer activation amax measured by the GX workers' --calib on the same model and run. The GEMM epilogue is invariant because a2_gscale*g2_alpha always equals the pack weight_scale_2.",
